{"id":"52184c84df392b80","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-incompleteness-recursive-extension.md","title":"Incompleteness for Recursive Extensions","display":"thm-incompleteness-recursive-extension — Incompleteness for Recursive Extensions","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-incompleteness-recursive-extension","aliases":["92-thm-incompleteness-recursive-extension"],"display":"thm-incompleteness-recursive-extension — Incompleteness for Recursive Extensions","depends_on":["[[92-df-recursive-extension]]","[[92-thm-essentially-undecidable]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-complete-system]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-theory-system]]"],"source":"第 VI 章 pp. 75–81；第 X 章 p. 112（PDF 92–98、129）","source_status":"原书思想的本地理论集呈现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-incompleteness-recursive-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-incompleteness-recursive-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-incompleteness-recursive-extension — Incompleteness for Recursive Extensions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3639c5e689e29d7\" href=\"?note=e3639c5e689e29d7\" title=\"92-df-recursive-extension\">92-df-recursive-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"38545b094b915076\" href=\"?note=38545b094b915076\" title=\"92-thm-essentially-undecidable\">92-thm-essentially-undecidable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c04baacf4202d9f7\" href=\"?note=c04baacf4202d9f7\" title=\"92-df-complete-system\">92-df-complete-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"09b80989dbe14044\" href=\"?note=09b80989dbe14044\" title=\"92-df-theory-system\">92-df-theory-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VI 章 pp. 75–81；第 X 章 p. 112（PDF 92–98、129）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书思想的本地理论集呈现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,T&#39;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(T,T&#39;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (base theory and extension)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T&#39;),\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T&#39;),\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\)</span> (canonical formal-system presentations, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"09b80989dbe14044\" href=\"?note=09b80989dbe14044\" title=\"92-df-theory-system\">92-df-theory-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq T\">\\(Q\\subseteq T\\)</span> (sufficient arithmetic strength)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T&#39;))\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T&#39;))\\)</span> (external consistency, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecExt}_G(T&#39;,T)\">\\(\\mathrm{RecExt}_G(T&#39;,T)\\)</span> (recursive-extension relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e3639c5e689e29d7\" href=\"?note=e3639c5e689e29d7\" title=\"92-df-recursive-extension\">92-df-recursive-extension</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Complete}\">\\(\\mathrm{Complete}\\)</span> (completeness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"c04baacf4202d9f7\" href=\"?note=c04baacf4202d9f7\" title=\"92-df-complete-system\">92-df-complete-system</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq T\\land\\mathrm{RecExt}_G(T&#39;,T)\\land\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T&#39;))\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T&#39;))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq T\\land\\mathrm{RecExt}_G(T&#39;,T)\\land\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T&#39;))\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T&#39;))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一致递归扩展不完备定理</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G&#39;\">\\(G&#39;\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>的递归扩展且一致，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G&#39;\">\\(G&#39;\\)</span>不完备</li>\n<li>这是本质不完备性定理的另一表述</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T&#39;\">\\(T&#39;\\)</span>是句子集，而<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Complete}\">\\(\\mathrm{Complete}\\)</span>作用于其规范形式系统呈现<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T&#39;)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T&#39;)\\)</span></li>\n<li>不能通过添加递归公理集完备化<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span></li>\n<li>添加有限多个Gödel句或一致性句不会破坏有效公理化；若所得闭合理论仍相容并含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>，它仍不完备</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>将递归公理呈现配上经典演算，然后用可证 Q 和普通一致性应用一般不完备性。T、T′ 是闭句理论集合，Sys_G 是标准带逻辑公理的呈现；名称 recursive extension 不豁免有效性条件。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VI 章 pp. 75–81；第 X 章 p. 112（PDF 92–98、129）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-recursive-extension","status":"resolved","id":"e3639c5e689e29d7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-essentially-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"38545b094b915076","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-essentially-undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-complete-system","status":"resolved","id":"c04baacf4202d9f7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-complete-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-system","status":"resolved","id":"09b80989dbe14044","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-system","status":"resolved","id":"09b80989dbe14044","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T'),\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)$ (canonical formal-system presentations, see [[92-df-theory-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T'))$ (external consistency, see [[92-df-consistent]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-extension","status":"resolved","id":"e3639c5e689e29d7","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecExt}_G(T',T)$ (recursive-extension relation, see [[92-df-recursive-extension]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-complete-system","status":"resolved","id":"c04baacf4202d9f7","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Complete}$ (completeness predicate, see [[92-df-complete-system]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,T'\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T'),\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T'))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecExt}_G(T',T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Complete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq T\\land\\mathrm{RecExt}_G(T',T)\\land\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T'))\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T'))","display":true},{"tex":"G'","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G'","display":false},{"tex":"T'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Complete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T')","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false}],"bytes":2240,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-279","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-incompleteness-recursive-extension]]"}],"outgoing":["e3639c5e689e29d7","38545b094b915076","c7befd96bd551ade","c04baacf4202d9f7","468d35690d25ee42","90f32e29c9d553ed","09b80989dbe14044"]}